UPDATE statement

CRUD stands for : 
	
	C -> Create
	R -> Read
	U -> Update
	D -> Delete
	
* HTTP POST : can be used to create an employee

* HTTP GET : ca be used retrieve employees

* HTTP PUT : can be used to update employee

* HTTP DELETE : can be used to delete an employee

